        "cooked": "<p>I thought we already had a thread for this! :O</p>\n<p>All I remember is that I finished off Plague Rat after unwrapping Guise's presents, because he accidentally stole the Dual Crowbars and was dealing 8-&gt;13 at the end of every turn with Blatant Reference. It didn't even matter that Dr. Medico succumbed to his start of turn damage that round, the game was over on his turn. XD</p>",
